          "source_text": "Given a category <MATH_0001> and an object <MATH_0002>\nwe define the <TEXTITOPEN_0001>category of objects under <MATH_0003><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>,\ndenoted <MATH_0004> as follows.\nThe objects of <MATH_0005> are morphisms <MATH_0006> for\nsome <MATH_0007>. Morphisms between objects\n<MATH_0008> and <MATH_0009> are morphisms <MATH_0010> in <MATH_0011> that\nmake the obvious diagram commute. Note that there is a functor\n<MATH_0012> which simply forgets the\nmorphism. Moreover given a morphism <MATH_0013> in\n<MATH_0014> there is an induced functor\n<MATH_0015>\nobtained by composition with <MATH_0016>,\nand <MATH_0017>.\n",
